{"video":"Exo1T9FsUAo","lines":[{"t":[0,1.8],"en":"- Sorry, gang."},{"t":[1.8,3.8],"en":"I thought my juggling stuff was in the trunk of my car,"},{"t":[3.8,5],"en":"but it's not."},{"t":[5,7.3],"en":"- Oh, no. Do you think it was stolen?"},{"t":[7.3,8.7],"en":"- I got you covered, boss."},{"t":[8.7,12.2],"en":"Used to play with the parabolas myself."},{"t":[12.2,13.6],"en":"Got some extra balls."},{"t":[13.6,15.3],"en":"Hey!"},{"t":[15.3,20.3],"en":"- I'm sorry, I never touch another juggler's instruments."},{"t":[20.3,22.4],"en":"You know, we're all here."},{"t":[22.4,23.5],"en":"I've got the music cued."},{"t":[23.5,25.8],"en":"Why don't I just do my routine without the juggling balls?"},{"t":[27.3,30.9],"en":"- Prepare to go into the danger zone."},{"t":[35.5,36.6],"en":"- Oh, wow, you weren't kidding."},{"t":[36.6,37.6],"en":"- No, never."},{"t":[38.9,43],"en":"Can someone please throw me a fifth ball?"},{"t":[43,44.1],"en":"If you dare."},{"t":[45.5,48],"en":"Incoming and wrong."},{"t":[49.5,51.2],"en":"Remember, nothing's impossible."},{"t":[53.7,54.8],"en":"- Wake me up."},{"t":[54.8,56.4],"en":"Wake me up inside."},{"t":[56.4,58.6],"en":"- Wake me up, wake me up inside."},{"t":[58.6,62.9],"en":"Call my name and save me from all the monsters."},{"t":[62.9,65.9],"en":"- Wake me up, fit my blood to run away."},{"t":[65.9,67.4],"en":"- Phyllis, where's Phyllis?"},{"t":[67.4,68.5],"en":"- Here."},{"t":[70.3,71.5],"en":"- Do you believe in me, Phyllis?"},{"t":[71.5,72.4],"en":"- Yes."},{"t":[72.4,73.4],"en":"- 'Cause I believe in you."},{"t":[73.4,74.4],"en":"- Oh, okay."},{"t":[79.4,80.4],"en":"- Feel that connection?"},{"t":[81.4,84.4],"en":"Don't move your head, please, thank you."},{"t":[85.6,87.7],"en":"- Ugh, big ad for Phyllis."},{"t":[88.9,90.1],"en":"That took a lot of guts."},{"t":[94.1,95.1],"en":"- Whoa."},{"t":[95.1,96],"en":"- Whoa!"},{"t":[98,99.5],"en":"I'm D'Angelo Vickers."},{"t":[99.5,101.7],"en":"Thank you so much, hope you learned something."},{"t":[101.7,102.8],"en":"Whoo!"},{"t":[102.8,103.6],"en":"- Whoo!"},{"t":[104.6,107.1],"en":"- He didn't drop a single ball."},{"t":[107.1,107.8],"en":"I'm D'Angelo Vickers."},{"t":[107.8,108.6],"en":"- I'm D'Angelo Vickers."},{"t":[108.6,109.4],"en":"- I'm D'Angelo Vickers."},{"t":[109.4,110.5],"en":"- You're a single ball."},{"t":[110.5,112.3],"en":"-"}]}
